mc-tui (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add optional OpenJDK 8/17/21/25 JRE installation via apt.
  * Add theme presets and appearance settings for the TUI.
  * Add download-page version search with exact-match selection.
  * Improve concurrent downloading: resume, de-duplication, error reporting.
  * Generate the About build time at package build time.
  * Derive launcher version tokens from mc_tui.__version__.

