mc-tui (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package release of MC-TUI.
  * Packaged pure Python implementation with zero pip dependencies.
  * Added CLI command `/usr/bin/mc-tui` and desktop launcher entry.

